; MoneyDancer 2.0 — XAUUSD STEP + S2.C.8 Daily Pre-Close Flatten (test variant)
; Date: 2026-05-21
;
; Same as XAUUSD_2.0_STEP_ship.set except:
;   DailyPreCloseHour=23
;   DailyPreCloseMinute=55
;   DailyResumeHour=1
;
; Hypothesis: pre-closing every night 5 min before the XAU daily-break window
; eliminates the "basket bleeds during market-closed" mechanism that caused
; may25-H2's 40.48% DD breach. Cost: forfeits intraday baskets that would have
; closed in profit overnight + day-1 cold start every morning.
;
; Expected outcome:
;   Max DD across 17 cells: 37.79% -> < 35%
;   Total profit: minor regression (overnight winners forfeited)
;   may25-H2 OOS: < 30% DD when re-run

